# Files in the repo that must NOT be served on the live guest site.
# Cloudflare serves the repo root as static assets, so without this list the
# SQL migrations, README, screenshots and config were all publicly reachable
# (verified 2026-09-17: /README.md, /db/*.sql, /wrangler.jsonc, /.gitignore
# all returned 200). App files (html, css/, js/, assets/, _headers) stay out
# of this list on purpose.
docs/
db/
tmp/
*.md
wrangler.jsonc
.gitignore
.assetsignore
